(7480566, 1189993, 124815, '<td valign="top">Give your sitter a raise -he''s doing a great job for you!<br/>The shadow is a bit caricatural giving a sort of humorous bend to the story. Processing is spot on</td>', 'Give your sitter a raise -he''s doing a great job for you!The shadow is a bit caricatural giving a sort of humorous bend to the story. Processing is spot on', '2016-11-02 23:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
