(7481699, 1190018, 114285, '<td valign="top">Very disturbing image Christophe~ Looking forward to reading the notes. I''m trying to work out what a jug of water and sink-hole drains embedded in one''s forehead are picturing, I''m sure with your wild imagination you will come up with something that either makes sense to you, and no one else.</td>', 'Very disturbing image Christophe~ Looking forward to reading the notes. I''m trying to work out what a jug of water and sink-hole drains embedded in one''s forehead are picturing, I''m sure with your wild imagination you will come up with something that either makes sense to you, and no one else.', '2016-11-08 23:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
