(7481765, 1190018, 135744, '<td valign="top">First of all congratulations on the blue ribbon.<br/> <br/>I feel honoured that you share these amazing creations with us. I know you must spend a great deal of time in planning and execution of these superb images so thank you for putting this effort to entertain our eyes and our minds. I hope you go down in history as a famous French artist - you sure deserve to.</td>', 'First of all congratulations on the blue ribbon. I feel honoured that you share these amazing creations with us. I know you must spend a great deal of time in planning and execution of these superb images so thank you for putting this effort to entertain our eyes and our minds. I hope you go down in history as a famous French artist - you sure deserve to.', '2016-11-09 05:29:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7481766, 1189987, 135744, '<td valign="top">Anita - there is no stopping you these days. Really excellent combination of photos and so expertly executed. A fantastic result on all fronts.</td>', 'Anita - there is no stopping you these days. Really excellent combination of photos and so expertly executed. A fantastic result on all fronts.', '2016-11-09 05:31:34.000000', NULL, 0),
