(7481812, 1190016, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Your image encapsulates the theme of the song well. Good props, I like your composition, focus and DOF it all works well together, the mono processing is good too. The text complements and explains the theme well. Sorry you didnt get any comments during the challenge, I hope this makes up for it, well done Fabio.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes well to the challenge Your image encapsulates the theme of the song well. Good props, I like your composition, focus and DOF it all works well together, the mono processing is good too. The text complements and explains the theme well. Sorry you didnt get any comments during the challenge, I hope this makes up for it, well done Fabio.', '2016-11-09 10:26:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7481813, 1189798, 101668, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, congrats</td>', 'Wonderful, congrats', '2016-11-09 10:26:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7481814, 1189933, 25024, '<td valign="top">I left a critique on this image yesterday, I''ve no idea where it has gone...</td>', 'I left a critique on this image yesterday, I''ve no idea where it has gone...', '2016-11-09 10:27:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7481815, 1189987, 101668, '<td valign="top">Very nice! You lazy? I don''t believe that for one second. Congrats</td>', 'Very nice! You lazy? I don''t believe that for one second. Congrats', '2016-11-09 10:28:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7481816, 1189543, 101668, '<td valign="top">Good job! Congrats</td>', 'Good job! Congrats', '2016-11-09 10:29:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7481817, 1189787, 101668, '<td valign="top">Good thinking, lovely image. Congrats</td>', 'Good thinking, lovely image. Congrats', '2016-11-09 10:30:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7481818, 1189827, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes to the challenge<br/> <br/>It looks more like the truck failed to stop! Im not too sure how effective your image is at conveying the message of change, the need to fill up with fuel is still current even though this particular venue is not. We can see that time is taking its toll on this site and slowly helping it to deteriorate but the change is very slow. I think something that represents a more recent development that impacts everyday life would have been better, for example, a wind farm generating power. I like the mono conversion and particularly like the sky. Thanks for your entry Louis.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes to the challenge It looks more like the truck failed to stop! Im not too sure how effective your image is at conveying the message of change, the need to fill up with fuel is still current even though this particular venue is not. We can see that time is taking its toll on this site and slowly helping it to deteriorate but the change is very slow. I think something that represents a more recent development that impacts everyday life would have been better, for example, a wind farm generating power. I like the mono conversion and particularly like the sky. Thanks for your entry Louis.', '2016-11-09 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7481821, 1189798, 19825, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and palette. To reiterate Paul''s comment, I really enjoy seeing and learning from your entries.</td>', 'Lovely composition and palette. To reiterate Paul''s comment, I really enjoy seeing and learning from your entries.', '2016-11-09 11:09:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7481877, 1189767, 50641, '<td valign="top">those are some crazy cheerleaders</td>', 'those are some crazy cheerleaders', '2016-11-09 18:11:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7481878, 1189798, 114969, '<td valign="top">You really are a master at toning your creations. Tattoos and spikes are usually shown as hard, cold and sometimes even disturbing features, while you easily manage to make everything look so soft, warm and attracting. A real visual oxymoron. Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'You really are a master at toning your creations. Tattoos and spikes are usually shown as hard, cold and sometimes even disturbing features, while you easily manage to make everything look so soft, warm and attracting. A real visual oxymoron. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2016-11-09 18:19:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7481879, 1189787, 114969, '<td valign="top">I just love it. What an impact! It is very interesting to look as such strong and contrasted lines used in such harmony. Very clever editing.</td>', 'I just love it. What an impact! It is very interesting to look as such strong and contrasted lines used in such harmony. Very clever editing.', '2016-11-09 18:23:47.000000', NULL, 0),
